## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Config["Config (.boukensha / settings.yml)"] --> Task["Player Task (provider, model, prompts)"]
    Task --> Context["Context (system, messages)"]
    Context --> Registry["Registry (look, move tools)"]
    Context --> PB["PromptBuilder"]
    Registry --> PB
    Backend["Backend (Gemini / Anthropic / OpenAI / Ollama / OllamaCloud)"] --> PB
    PB --> Payload["API Payload (dict -> JSON ready for POST)"]
```

### Backend Serialization Differences

| Feature | Anthropic | Gemini | OpenAI | Ollama / OllamaCloud |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **System Prompt** | Top-level `"system"` | Top-level `"systemInstruction"` | Message with `role: "system"` | Message with `role: "system"` |
| **Assistant Turn** | `role: "assistant"` | `role: "model"` | `role: "assistant"` | `role: "assistant"` |
| **Tool Result** | `role: "user"` with `tool_result` content block | `role: "user"` with `functionResponse` part | `role: "tool"` with `tool_call_id` | `role: "tool"` with `tool_name` |
| **Tools Format** | `tools: [{name, description, input_schema}]` | `tools: [{functionDeclarations: [...]}]` | `tools: [{type: "function", function: {...}}]` | `tools: [{type: "function", function: {...}}]` |
| **Model Validation** | Against `Anthropic.MODELS` | Against `Gemini.MODELS` | Against `OpenAI.MODELS` | Against `Ollama.MODELS` / `OllamaCloud.MODELS` |

