### Component 3: PromptBuilder & Module Exports

#### [NEW] `boukensha/prompt_builder.py`
Delegator class taking `context`, `backend`, and optional `registry`:
- `to_messages()`: delegates to `backend.to_messages` (handling 1-arg or 2-arg signatures).
- `to_tools()`: delegates to `backend.to_tools(self.tools)`.
- `to_api_payload(max_output_tokens=1024)`: delegates to `backend.to_payload(self.context, max_output_tokens)`.
- `headers`: delegates to `backend.headers`.
- `url`: delegates to `backend.url`.

